Litik: Oh! Hello...
Litik: I don't think I existed a minute ago.
Litik: You tried to answer your Ima back there, and I just... popped out.
Litik: I think I'm the piece of your voice that got stuck.
(Inner voice) What? How did this happen?......
Litik: We can figure it out later...
Litik: Apu's over there with a few villagers.
Litik: We can try and test how we greet there since it's [color=yellow][i]morning.[/i][/color]
Litik: Oh and also a quick tip...
Litik: For one person, add [color=yellow][i]keka.[/i][/color] A group, [color=yellow][i]kekayu.[/i][/color] Everyone at once, [color=yellow][i]kekayu ngan.[/i][/color]